  "whatsNewBody": "Gcina apho ugcina khona amakhadi akho nenombolo yokuvala yebhanki nganye. Ukuba ulahlekelwe yingxowa, uvala yonke into kwimizuzu.",
  "whatsNewDismiss": "Ndiyaqonda",
  "tutorialAddRecordMoreDetails2": "Iinkcukacha ezongezelelweyo ziqulethe izongezo: amanqaku, ukuphinda, ixesha lokuhlaziya, ukuba yeyabani, apho uyigcina khona, isitshixo neefoto. Yivule kuphela xa uyidinga.",
  "tutorialAddRecordProtect2": "Tshixa irekhodi ukuze lifune umnwe okanye isitshixo sesikrini phambi kokuboniswa. Khetha apho uligcina khona, njengengxowa yakho, uze wongeze iifoto zoxwebhu.",
  "tutorialSmartLostWallet2": "Ulahlekelwe yingxowa? Bona yonke into ebikuyo, tsalela ibhanki nganye ngokuchukumisa kanye uze ulandele amanyathelo okunye.",
  "tutorialSmartLifeEvents2": "Ukufuduka, umntwana, umsebenzi omtsha okanye imeko engxamisekileyo? Iziganeko zobomi zikunika isicwangciso esineerekhodi, amanyathelo nemihla yakho.",
