  "storyHome1Title": "Usuku lwakho ngokujonga kanye",
  "storyHome1Body": "Isikrini sasekhaya sibonisa okubalulekileyo namhlanje: okuza kuphelelwa kungekudala nenani leerekhodi onazo.",
  "storyHome2Title": "Fumana nantoni na",
  "storyHome2Body": "Cofa ukukhangela ukuze ufumane irekhodi ngegama, iqela okanye umntu.",
  "storyHome3Title": "Uhambo nezicwangciso",
  "storyHome3Body": "Uhambo olucwangcisayo nezicwangciso zeziganeko zobomi eziqhubekayo zivela apha, kunye nokuseleyo.",
  "storyHome4Title": "Uncedo ngokuchukumisa kanye",
  "storyHome4Body": "Iqhosha lentlantsi livula «Buza iVaultara». Ifoto yakho ivula iprofayile, iisetingi nezifundo.",
  "storyRenew1Title": "Kufika isikhumbuzi",
  "storyRenew1Body": "Phambi kokuba irekhodi liphelelwe, i-Vaultara iyakukhumbuza. Cofa isikhumbuzi ukuze uvule irekhodi.",
  "storyRenew2Title": "Gcina umhla omtsha",
  "storyRenew2Body": "Uhlaziyile? Cofa «Vuselela» uze ufake umhla omtsha wokuphelelwa. Izikhumbuzi zihamba nawo.",
  "storyRenew3Title": "Akuqinisekanga ukuba njani?",
  "storyRenew3Body": "Iirekhodi ezininzi zinesikhokelo esinamanyathelo, amaxwebhu neendleko eziqhelekileyo.",
  "storyRenew4Title": "Yiyeke iziphinde",
  "storyRenew4Body": "Kwimirhumo neentlawulo zonyaka, vula ukuphinda kwaye umhla uya kuhamba ngokwawo.",
  "storyAsk1Title": "Buza ngamazwi akho",
  "storyAsk1Body": "Buza izinto ezinjengokuthi «Yintoni ephelelwa kulo nyaka?» ufumane iimpendulo kwiirekhodi zakho.",
  "storyAsk2Title": "Thetha endaweni yokuchwetheza",
  "storyAsk2Body": "Cofa imakrofoni uze uthethe. Amagama akho avela njengoko uthetha kwaye ungathumela kwangoko.",
  "storyAsk3Title": "Nguwe oqinisekisa lonke utshintsho",
  "storyAsk3Body": "Cela ukongeza okanye ukutshintsha irekhodi uya kubona ikhadi kuqala. Akukho nto igcinwayo de uqinisekise.",
  "storyAsk4Title": "Rhoxisa nalo naluphi na utshintsho",
  "storyAsk4Body": "Utshintshe ingqondo? Lonke utshintsho oluqinisekisiweyo lungarhoxiswa kwikhadi elinye.",
  "storyAsk5Title": "Qhubeka apho uyeke khona",
  "storyAsk5Body": "Iincoko zigcinwa iintsuku ezingama-90 kwi-«Imbali yeencoko», kwaye imibuzo ecetyiswayo ikunceda uqale.",
  "storyWallet1Title": "Zilungiselele kuqala",
  "storyWallet1Body": "Vula ikhadi okanye uxwebhu uze ukhethe apho ulugcina khona, njengengxowa okanye ibhegi yakho.",
  "storyWallet2Title": "Gcina inombolo yokuvala",
  "storyWallet2Body": "Yongeza ngoku inombolo yokuvala yebhanki nganye. Ikwikhadi, ongazukuba nalo xa uyidinga.",
  "storyWallet3Title": "Ukuba ilahlekile",
  "storyWallet3Body": "Vula «Ndilahlekelwe sisikhwama sam» uze ucofe «Silahlekile» okanye «Sibiwe». I-Vaultara idwelisa yonke into ebikuyo.",
  "storyWallet4Title": "Vala amakhadi kwimizuzu",
  "storyWallet4Body": "Tsalela ibhanki nganye ngokuchukumisa kanye, phawula amakhadi njengavaliweyo uze ugcine inombolo yengxelo.",
  "storyWallet5Title": "Tshintsha kwaye uhlale ukhuselekile",
  "storyWallet5Body": "Faka amanye amaxwebhu, jonga iingxelo zeakhawunti xa ukhunjuzwa uze ucofe «Ndisifumene» ukuba iyavela.",
  "storyLife1Title": "Amaxesha amakhulu, isicwangciso esinye",
  "storyLife1Body": "Ukufuduka, umntwana, umsebenzi omtsha okanye imeko engxamisekileyo: khetha kwi-«Iziganeko zobomi» okwenzekayo.",
  "storyLife2Title": "Iirekhodi zakho zicwangcisiwe",
  "storyLife2Body": "Isicwangciso sibonisa ukuba zeziphi iirekhodi ekufuneka uzihlaziye, uzirhoxise okanye uzivuselele, nezo usenokufuna ukuzongeza.",
  "storyLife3Title": "Amanyathelo nemihla",
  "storyLife3Body": "Amanyathelo agubungela okungeyiyo irekhodi, kwaye imihla yokuqala ikuxelela ukuba ufake isicelo nini ukuze kungabikho nto ilibazisekayo.",
  "storyLife4Title": "Yenze ibe yeyakho",
  "storyLife4Body": "Yongeza amanyathelo akho, yabelana ngesicwangciso njenge-PDF uze ufumane izikhumbuzi kufutshane nomhla.",
  "storyPhotos1Title": "Iifoto zamaxwebhu akho",
  "storyPhotos1Body": "Kwirekhodi, yongeza iifoto zangaphambili nezangasemva zekhadi okanye zoxwebhu.",
  "storyPhotos2Title": "Zifihliwe kwifowuni yakho",
  "storyPhotos2Body": "Vula ukufihla iifoto kwaye ziyatshixwa kwifowuni phambi kokulayishwa.",
  "storyPhotos3Title": "Tshixa iirekhodi ezibuthathaka",
  "storyPhotos3Body": "Tshixa irekhodi kwaye liya kucela umnwe okanye isitshixo sesikrini phambi kokuvuleka.",
  "storyPhotos4Title": "Tshixa yonke i-app",
  "storyPhotos4Body": "Kwiisetingi zokhuseleko, vula isitshixo se-app uze ufihle umxholo xa utshintsha ii-app.",
  "storyShare1Title": "Yabelana ngerekhodi elinye",
  "storyShare1Body": "Vula irekhodi uze wabelane ngekhonkco elibonisa elo rekhodi kuphela, akukho nto yimbi.",
  "storyShare2Title": "Ipakethe yobungqina",
  "storyShare2Body": "Faka iirekhodi ozikhethayo, kunye neefoto zazo, kwi-PDF enye yomnini-ndlu, ibhanki okanye iofisi.",
  "storyShare3Title": "Hlala ulawula",
  "storyShare3Body": "«Amakhonkco owabelene ngawo» ibonisa lonke ikhonkco olenzileyo. Misa nalinye nanini na kwaye alisayi kuvuleka.",
  "storyHousehold1Title": "Mema usapho lwakho",
  "storyHousehold1Body": "Yabelana ngekhowudi okanye ikhonkco lesimemo. Umntu ngamnye ungena ngeakhawunti yakhe.",
  "storyHousehold2Title": "Iseti enye yeerekhodi",
  "storyHousehold2Body": "Wonke umntu ubona iirekhodi ezifanayo ekwabelwana ngazo kwaye ufumana izikhumbuzi ezifanayo.",
  "storyHousehold3Title": "Yeyabani?",
  "storyHousehold3Body": "Irekhodi ngalinye linokuba lelomntu othile. Igama lakhe libonakala kulo nakwizikhumbuzi.",
  "storyImport1Title": "Skena ikhadi",
  "storyImport1Body": "Thatha ifoto yekhadi okanye uxwebhu kwaye i-Vaultara izalisa igama nomhla wokuphelelwa.",
  "storyImport2Title": "Ngenisa uluhlu",
  "storyImport2Body": "Sele unayo ispredishithi? Yingenise uze ujonge umqolo ngamnye phambi kokuba kugcinwe nantoni na.",
  "storyImport3Title": "Yabelana ne-Vaultara",
  "storyImport3Body": "Yabelana ngefoto, i-PDF okanye isicatshulwa kwenye i-app ne-Vaultara ukuze uqale irekhodi elitsha.",
  "storyCosts1Title": "Ekhalendeni lakho",
  "storyCosts1Body": "Yongeza imihla yokuphelelwa ekhalendeni lefowuni, ecaleni kwezinye izicwangciso zakho.",
  "storyCosts2Title": "Ukuba kubiza malini ukuhlaziya",
  "storyCosts2Body": "Faka iindleko zokuhlaziya kwirekhodi kwaye i-Vaultara ibonisa ukuba uchitha malini ngonyaka.",
  "storyCosts3Title": "Cwangcisa kwangaphambili",
  "storyCosts3Body": "Bona iinyanga ezibizayo zisiza ukuze ukuhlaziya okukhulu kungaze kukumangalise.",
  "storyBusiness1Title": "Landela iqela lakho",
  "storyBusiness1Body": "Yongeza abasebenzi uze ugcine izatifikethi, iimvume neelayisensi zabo kwindawo enye.",
  "storyBusiness2Title": "Izikhumbuzi nge-imeyile",
  "storyBusiness2Body": "Abasebenzi bafumana ii-imeyile phambi kokuba amaxwebhu abo aphelelwe, nokuba abanayo i-app.",
  "storyBusiness3Title": "Ingxelo yenyanga",
  "storyBusiness3Body": "Inyanga nganye ingxelo ibonisa okusebenzayo, okuphelelwayo nokungekhoyo.",
  "storyBusiness4Title": "Cela uhlaziyo",
  "storyBusiness4Body": "Thumela ikhonkco kwaye umsebenzi alayishe ngokwakhe uxwebhu oluhlaziyiweyo.",
